		{"id":"50f6e035972065f9","type":"text","text":"# ~={cyan}MVR=~\n\n![[Screenshot 2026-07-28 114023.png]]\n\nExchange with vapor to condensate at the Calandria. The condensate falls down to the bottom and the vapor mixture goes into a separator, where the unused vapor and recycled and recompressed with a strong turbo fan to increase pressure and temperature for the next cycle","x":-5290,"y":961,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
