		{"id":"04e2dde29adde56b","type":"text","text":"# ~={cyan}Solar Thermal=~\n\nThere are three main types of solar thermal\n\n- Evacuated Tube - $200\\degree C$\n- Parabolic Trough - $230 \\degree C$\n- Fresnel - $400 \\degree C$","x":-5536,"y":379,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"5"},
